target: skills/review/review-loop/runlog.py
verify: cd skills/review/review-loop && ./runlog.test.sh
expect: a cycle row after finish is refused
why:    a cycle row appended after finish rewrites a convergence already disclosed on a PR and already cleared for push
--- old
    prior = load(limit=None).get(a.run_id) or {}
    if prior.get("finished_at") or prior.get("outcome"):
        sys.exit(f"runlog: run {a.run_id!r} is already finished — a cycle row appended now "
                 "would change a convergence that has already been reported. Start a new run.")

--- new

